00:33:07,231 --> 00:33:11,177
Speaker 0: And it's like, it's sort of, you know, mindless, like just pee, pee, pee, pee, pee, pee, pee.

402
00:33:11,217 --> 00:33:18,370
Speaker 1: Like you're, it's not really, it's like, it would be fine if the progression I had with Metroid specifically was when I first started playing the game.

